      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-017",
        "start": 67.82,
        "end": 72.483,
        "midpoint": 70.151,
        "text": "但sora的问题在于算力，算力还是算力，根据一位大佬的推理",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-017.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-018",
        "start": 72.483,
        "end": 76.39,
        "midpoint": 74.436,
        "text": "Sora生成一分钟的视频，用八张a幺零零的gpu",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-018.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-019",
        "start": 76.4,
        "end": 79.634,
        "midpoint": 78.017,
        "text": "也要三小时以上，而在今天凌晨的采访中",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-019.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-020",
        "start": 79.634,
        "end": 85.17,
        "midpoint": 82.402,
        "text": "Openai的cto说生成一段二十秒长的七百二十p视频，只用了几分钟",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-020.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-021",
        "start": 85.56,
        "end": 87.56,
        "midpoint": 86.56,
        "text": "这个具体的时间我们不得而知",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-021.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-022",
        "start": 87.88,
        "end": 93.85,
        "midpoint": 90.865,
        "text": "可以肯定的是，Ai生成的视频难以保证每次的画面都可用，仍然很随机",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-022.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-023",
        "start": 93.86,
        "end": 97.966,
        "midpoint": 95.913,
        "text": "你抽很多次卡也不一定能得到想要的画面，就像你约会八百次",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-023.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-024",
        "start": 97.966,
        "end": 99.43,
        "midpoint": 98.698,
        "text": "也遇不到看着顺眼的人",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-024.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-025",
        "start": 99.44,
        "end": 105.501,
        "midpoint": 102.471,
        "text": "这也是为啥openai ceo奥特曼四处奔波要拉七万亿投资制造ai芯片",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-025.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-026",
        "start": 105.501,
        "end": 107.41,
        "midpoint": 106.456,
        "text": "山姆等等，你需要多少？",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-026.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-027",
        "start": 107.42,
        "end": 110.088,
        "midpoint": 108.754,
        "text": "五到七万亿大概不对",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-027.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-028",
        "start": 110.088,
        "end": 113.528,
        "midpoint": 111.808,
        "text": "只是这比世界上几乎所有国家的GDP都要高",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-028.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-029",
        "start": 113.528,
        "end": 117.36,
        "midpoint": 115.444,
        "text": "这也是为啥，因为答案能一路躺到两万亿的估值",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-029.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-030",
        "start": 117.67,
        "end": 122.357,
        "midpoint": 120.013,
        "text": "因为siri对算力的需求太恐怖了，用户抽的每一次卡都在烧钱",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-030.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-031",
        "start": 122.357,
        "end": 127.5,
        "midpoint": 124.928,
        "text": "另一篇报道里也写chatgpt每天要消耗五十万千瓦的电力",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-031.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-032",
        "start": 127.51,
        "end": 131.21,
        "midpoint": 129.36,
        "text": "Sora只会更高。所以在算力没有跟上以前",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-032.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-033",
        "start": 131.21,
        "end": 135.713,
        "midpoint": 133.462,
        "text": "索尔是不会向公众开放的，即使开放订阅费也注定会极其昂贵",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-033.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-034",
        "start": 135.713,
        "end": 138.61,
        "midpoint": 137.161,
        "text": "除非openai开源部分的索尔的技术",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-034.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-035",
        "start": 138.62,
        "end": 142.18,
        "midpoint": 140.4,
        "text": "让社区共同参与到开发和维护里，把价格打下来",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-035.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-036",
        "start": 142.18,
        "end": 144.92,
        "midpoint": 143.55,
        "text": "但考虑到open ai毕竟又叫close ai",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-036.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-037",
        "start": 145.22,
        "end": 146.79,
        "midpoint": 146.005,
        "text": "开源肯定不切实际",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-037.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-038",
        "start": 147.1,
        "end": 152.72,
        "midpoint": 149.91,
        "text": "再说说索尔的第二个问题，他到底能不能模拟现实，有没有理解物理世界的能力？",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-038.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-039",
        "start": 152.73,
        "end": 159.81,
        "midpoint": 156.27,
        "text": "从官方的样片来看有但不多，比如咖啡杯里海盗船这段能看到他俩互相撞击",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-039.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-040",
        "start": 159.81,
        "end": 162.867,
        "midpoint": 161.339,
        "text": "让水波随之而动。这基本符合物理规律",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-040.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 162.867,
        "end": 167.2,
        "midpoint": 165.034,
        "text": "但也有很多翻车片段，最有意思的就是这个吹蜡烛的画面",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-041.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 167.51,
        "end": 173.03,
        "midpoint": 170.27,
        "text": "什么呀，笨死了，蜡烛没吹掉，违背了物理现实，另外也有报道提到",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-042.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 173.04,
        "end": 177.134,
        "midpoint": 175.087,
        "text": "既然siri能模拟现实，那他更要考虑到社会中的人情世故",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-043.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 177.134,
        "end": 178.96,
        "midpoint": 178.047,
        "text": "要理解人类的复杂行为",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-044.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 178.97,
        "end": 184.342,
        "midpoint": 181.656,
        "text": "比如现在一个人手里有一瓶娃哈哈和农夫山泉，索尔能预测这人该喝哪瓶",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-045.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 184.342,
        "end": 187.86,
        "midpoint": 186.101,
        "text": "这些都是索尔上线以前他需要解决和优化的问题",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-046.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 188.16,
        "end": 192.898,
        "midpoint": 190.529,
        "text": "总结一下，考虑到sura的使用成本，它注定就不是给大部分人准备的",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-047.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 192.898,
        "end": 196.15,
        "midpoint": 194.524,
        "text": "而是那些有金主爸爸养着的大型影视公司",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-048.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 196.16,
        "end": 201.73,
        "midpoint": 198.945,
        "text": "广告公司，内容公司sora也不只是视频生成器，而是未来agi的大脑",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-049.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 202.27,
        "end": 206.518,
        "midpoint": 204.394,
        "text": "不过好在，在索尔这棵苍天大树下，正在长出缤纷的ai工具",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-050.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 206.518,
        "end": 207.47,
        "midpoint": 206.994,
        "text": "跑道",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-051.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 207.47,
        "end": 210.24,
        "midpoint": 208.855,
        "text": "皮卡svd，Big swords都挺香的",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-052.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 210.25,
        "end": 216.29,
        "midpoint": 213.27,
        "text": "又不是用red和阿来才能拍电影，用手机也可以，还是那句话，Ai只是工具",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-053.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 216.29,
        "end": 219.89,
        "midpoint": 218.09,
        "text": "关键看你要讲怎样的故事，如何放大自我的魅力",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-054.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-055",
        "start": 220.22,
        "end": 224.32,
        "midpoint": 222.27,
        "text": "愿在勒紧裤腰带过日子的现在，Ai让我们都有美好的未来",
        "frame": "frames-transcript/cue-055.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
